  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You keep your magical power and martial focus in perfect balance, converting spell slots into Focus Points or Focus Points into spell slots.</p><p><strong>Converting Spell Slots to Focus Points.</strong> You can expend a spell slot to regain expended Focus Points equal to the slot's level (no action required).</p><p><strong>Recovering Spell Slots.</strong> When you finish a Short Rest or use Uncanny Metabolism, you can transform unexpended Focus Points to recover one expended spell slot, of level 4 or lower, at the cost shown on the Recovering Spell Slots table (which also gives the minimum Monk level).</p><table><thead><tr><th>Spell Slot Level</th><th>Focus Point Cost</th><th>Min. Monk Level</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>5</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>6</td><td>19</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-HCNirWVlbHYClB0j\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Slot to Focus spends a spell slot and restores Focus Points equal to its level (choose the level in the dialog). Recovering slots with Focus Points is done by hand.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
